Need careful mapping because kind values: rain, fog, sand, snow, storm, aurora, ash, acid, cosmic, monsoon, sunset, heat, smog, mist, ice, solar, overcast, meteor, clouds, eclipse, arcane, starfall, phantom, chrono. Also `clear`.

Categorize:
- falling: rain, monsoon, acid, storm, snow, ice, mist, overcast, clouds, fog, rainforest? (mist)
- rising: ash, ember? (no ember kind; ash), solar, sunset (drift), heat (rise), smog (drift)
- wind: sand, dust (not weather kind; sand), sunset, smog, heat
- orbital: cosmic, aurora, meteor, eclipse, arcane, starfall, phantom, chrono, gravity? (kind cosmic)
- `fog`, `mist`, `clouds` slow drift.
Per particle update:
```
