content.text:
Potential issue: `_toggleAutoRace` calls store emits 'selected', `_onStore` if tab==='race' and !raceView will... currently nothing. The clicked button itself updates via `_syncAutoRaceUI`. Good.

Now CSS additions. Append at end of style.css (before reduced motion? Order not critical). We'll add after existing `.pack-feature` at end. Include shop, feature dock, auto race. Also maybe hide feature during racing/inspecting.

Let's write CSS carefully mobile-first.

Feature dock:
```
.feature-dock{position:fixed;z-index:28;top:calc(82px + env(safe-area-inset-top,0px));right:max(10px,calc((100vw - var(--app-w))/2 + 10px));display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-end;gap:8px;pointer-events:none}
```
Since app max width 520 centered, right offset on desktop. `right: max(...)` with calc; supported.
But pointer-events on children auto.
Button 40x40, border radius 13, background rgba(8,11,18,.58), border 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16), backdrop-filter blur(14px), color cyan, inset highlight, shadow.
SVG 20x20 stroke currentColor fill none stroke-width 1.6.

Menu:
```
.feature-menu{pointer-events:auto;width:min(240px,calc(100vw - 24px));padding:8px;border-radius:16px;background:linear-gradient(160deg,rgba(20,26,40,.82),rgba(7,10,17,.9));border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);box-shadow:0 18px 44px rgba(0,0,0,.55),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.16);backdrop-filter:blur(18px) saturate(140%);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;transform-origin:top right;animation:menuIn .18s...}
.feature-menu[hidden]{display:none}
.feature-kicker{...}
.feature-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:7px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.025);border:1px solid transparent;text-align:left;width:100%}
.feature-item:active{background:rgba(255,255,255,.07)}
.fi-ico{width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:8px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--fi);flex:0 0 auto}
.fi-ico svg{width:15px;height:15px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.7;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 4px currentColor)}
.fi-copy{min-width:0;display:block}
.fi-copy b{display:block;font-size:8.5px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}
.fi-copy em{display:block;font-style:normal;font-size:6.5px;color:var(--dim);margin-top:1px;line-height:1.25}
```
Feature button open state rotate icon 90? maybe.
Hide during racing/inspecting via `.racing .feature-dock,.inspecting .feature-dock{opacity:0;pointer-events:none}`.

Shop CSS:
```
.shop-head{position:relative;display:flex... padding:10px 10px 10px 13px;margin-bottom:10px;border-radius:13px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(255,255,255,.07),rgba(255,255,255,.02));border:1px solid var(--line-2);overflow:hidden}
.shop-head::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:3px;background:var(--sc);box-shadow:0 0 12px var(--sc)}
.shop-head>div{min-width:0;flex:1}
.shop-head .eyebrow{...}
.shop-head b{display:block;font-size:13px...}
.shop-head small{display:block;font-size:7.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.4;margin-top:2px}
.shop-head .pill{flex:0 0 auto}
.shop-section{margin-bottom:10px}
.shop-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px}
.shop-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:7px 8px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);border:1px solid var(--line)}
.shop-row.active{border-color:var(--sc);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--sc) inset, 0 0 16px ...} can't rgba var. Use box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--sc), 0 0 14px rgba(255,255,255,.04).
.shop-row.locked{opacity:.72}
.shop-dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--sc);box-shadow:0 0 7px var(--sc);flex:0 0 auto}
.shop-copy{min-width:0;flex:1}
.shop-copy b{display:block;font-size:8.5px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.shop-copy span{display:block;font-size:6.5px;color:var(--dim);line-height:1.35;margin-top:1px}
.shop-btn{min-width:54px;height:28px;padding:0 8px;border-radius:7px;font-size:6.5px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.05em;background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);border:1px solid var(--line-2);color:#eaf1ff;white-space:nowrap}
.shop-btn.on{background:rgba(67,255,163,.14);border-color:rgba(67,255,163,.38);color:#a8ffd5}
.shop-btn:disabled{opacity:.5}
.shop-btn:active{transform:scale(.95)}
.shop-tag{font-size:6px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--dim);border:1px dashed var(--line-2);padding:4px 6px;border-radius:5px;white-space:nowrap}
```
Note `.shop-row.active .shop-dot` accent okay.

Fuse stats/cost:
```
.fuse-stats{display:flex;gap:5px;margin-bottom:8px}
.fuse-stats span{flex:1;text-align:center;padding:5px;border-radius:7px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.035);border:1px solid var(--line);font-size:6.5px;color:var(--dim);letter-spacing:.08em}
.fuse-stats b{display:block;font-size:11px;color:#eaf4ff;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;margin-top:1px}
.fuse-cost{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:4px;margin-bottom:8px}
.fuse-cost span{text-align:center;padding:5px 3px;border-radius:6px;font-size:6.5px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.03em;color:#ff9aa0;background:rgba(255,90,99,.07);border:1px solid rgba(255,90,99,.18)}
.fuse-cost span.ok{color:#9dffd0;background:rgba(67,255,163,.08);border-color:rgba(67,255,163,.2)}
```

Auto race:
```
.race-auto{flex:0 0 62px!important;flex-direction:column?}
```
The base `.race-pill` is flex row with baseline. We want button with span + b. We can style `.race-auto{flex:0 0 64px;gap:3px;padding:0 4px;color:var(--cyan);}` `.race-auto b{font-size:10px;color:var(--dim)}` `.race-auto.on{background:rgba(79,227,255,.16);border-color:rgba(79,227,255,.5);box-shadow:0 0 16px rgba(79,227,255,.25),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.16)}` `.race-auto.on b{color:#c9fff1}`.

Auto race chip in panel:
```
.auto-race-chip{flex:0 0 62px;min-height:46px;border-radius:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:1px;background:linear-gradient(160deg,rgba(255,255,255,.09),rgba(255,255,255,.03));border:1px solid var(--line-2)}
.auto-race-chip span{font-size:6.5px;letter-spacing:.13em;font-weight:900;color:var(--dim)}
.auto-race-chip b{font-size:11px;font-weight:900;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.05em}
.auto-race-chip.on{background:linear-gradient(160deg,rgba(79,227,255,.24),rgba(21,119,255,.1));border-color:rgba(79,227,255,.55);box-shadow:0 0 16px rgba(79,227,255,.22),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.2)}
.auto-race-chip.on b{color:#d6ffff}
```
Need panel `.race-launch .btn-primary{flex:1}` remains.

Animation:
```
@keyframes menuIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-5px) scale(.97)}to{...}}
```
Add.

Also possibly `.shop-head .shop-copy` conflicts? no.

Let's append.

